Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:15.82,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:15.82,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}中岛布兰登 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 弗里茨 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Brandon, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,布兰登 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing, I thought you played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这样 我觉得你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,with huge courage at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在最后阶段打得很有胆量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,You were really going after the forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一直在放手打正手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.54,EN,,0,0,0,,What gave you the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么让你有底气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:12.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to do that and seize the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,去这么做 抓住那个时刻？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think just getting a lot of confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我想是这些比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.94,EN,,0,0,0,,from all these matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了我很多信心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:17.58,EN,,0,0,0,,When it comes down to the wire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,打到决胜时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.94,EN,,0,0,0,,in the third set, just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,打到第三盘的关键分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to trust my game fully and just really proud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就想完全信任自己的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:24.14,EN,,0,0,0,,of how I ended the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:24.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,为自己结束这场球的方式骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:25.56,EN,,0,0,0,,What learnings were there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你学到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:26.54,EN,,0,0,0,,from the match you played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,是从你最近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:28.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in Washington recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,在华盛顿那场比赛里？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:28.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:28.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean the match in Washington I felt like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,华盛顿那场 我感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.02,EN,,0,0,0,,from the baseline I wasn't playing that well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,底线相持打得不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:35.06,EN,,0,0,0,,I wasn't hitting through my shots as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,击球没有打透
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:35.98,EN,,0,0,0,,So today I was really trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:35.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以今天我更想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.34,EN,,0,0,0,,to hit the forehand a little bit bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,把正手打得更狠一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.98,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know staying solid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,反手也保持稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.34,EN,,0,0,0,,on the backhand and I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:42.30,EN,,0,0,0,,that was what got me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是我能撑下来的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.90,EN,,0,0,0,,If I was to have told you after Wimbledon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果温网结束后我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:45.86,EN,,0,0,0,,you'd play Washington semi-finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会打进华盛顿半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:48.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Montreal final and now Cincy semi-final,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,蒙特利尔决赛 辛辛那提半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.66,EN,,0,0,0,,what would you have told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会怎么回我？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.02,EN,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have believed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不会相信你的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:55.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been a lot these last few weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几个星期经历了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:57.42,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多情绪起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:58.32,EN,,0,0,0,,you know a lot of hours out here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上待了很长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:00.90,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court but in the end I'm super happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,但最后我对这个状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,with my level and yeah just really proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常满意 也真心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.18,EN,,0,0,0,,of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,为自己感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:05.22,EN,,0,0,0,,So what opportunity have you got
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来这个周末
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:07.16,EN,,0,0,0,,this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还有什么机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:07.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Another opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:07.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,又一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to win some more matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,再多赢几场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean I'll try my best, get some recovery
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会尽力 好好恢复一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and we'll see how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看能打成什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.28,0:01:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Great job, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.28,0:01:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮 干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:15.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Alright, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 谢谢
